			<description>Dwarves receive a +1 bonus on attack rolls against humanoid creatures of the orc and goblinoid subtypes due to special training against these hated foes.</description>
			<type>RACIALTRAITS.DWARF RACIAL TRAIT.DWARF RACIAL DEFAULT.SPECIALATTACK.SPECIAL ATTACK.RACIALHATRED</type>
			<associated></associated>
			<count>0</count>
			<aspect>CombatBonus: +1 bonus on attack rolls against humanoid creatures of the orc and goblinoid subtypes due to special training against these hated foes., StatBlockName: +1 on attack rolls against goblinoid and orc humanoids</aspect>
