		</special_attack>
		<special_attack>
			<name>Judgment / Piercing</name>
			<description>This judgment gives the inquisitor great focus and makes her spells more potent. This benefit grants a +2 profane bonus on concentration checks and caster level checks made to overcome a target&#39;s spell resistance.</description>
