						<dc>19</dc>
						<duration>Concentration, up to 5 rounds</duration>
						<effect>You know if the target deliberately and knowingly speaks a lie by discerning disturbances in its aura caused by lying.</effect>
						<target>5 creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart</target>
